    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_version_label">Version 1.0.0</string>
    <string name="about_dev_info">Crafted with native Android APIs (WindowManager, AccessibilityService, Foreground Service, DynamicAnimation, and Material Design 3).</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_title">Privacy &amp; Transparency Policy</string>
    <string name="about_privacy_body">TouchFlow operates 100% locally on your device.\n\n• Zero Data Collection: TouchFlow does not collect, store, transmit, or share personal data, keystrokes, screen contents, or usage analytics.\n\n• Accessibility Service Usage: Used exclusively to execute user-initiated global actions (Home, Back, Recent Apps, Screenshot, Lock Screen, Notifications, Quick Settings, Power Dialog). Window content retrieval is disabled.\n\n• Overlay &amp; Foreground Service: Used only while TouchFlow is enabled to keep the floating assistant button visible and responsive.\n\n• Package Queries: Used only to let you pick up to 8 installed launcher apps for your personal shortcut list.</string>

